Short:        Example source code for a progress bar
Author:       dave@eclipsnz.manawatu.gen.nz
Uploader:     dave eclipsnz manawatu gen nz
Type:         dev/asm
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

This is a quick progress bar that I wrote as an example for someone to
use.  There are two different types of bars, a normal blue bar in a
recessed bevel box; and a raised bevel box in a recessed bevel box.

A quick main program has been included so you can see how to make use of
the various functions in the routines.
